          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--accent:#7b5cff;--muted:#6b6970;--bg:#fff;--card:#fbfbfd;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#111}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 36px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\\n    nav a{color:#222;text-decoration:none;margin:0 12px;font-weight:600}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:0 20px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:32px;align-items:center;padding:32px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff, #faf8ff);border-radius:12px}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:28px;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .hero p{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 16px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .pillars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:28px}\\n    .pillar{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:28px}\\n    .myth, .truth{padding:16px;border-radius:8px}\\n    .myth{background:#fff6f9;border:1px solid #f2dce9}\\n    .truth{background:#f6fffb;border:1px solid #d9f4ea}\\n    .case{margin-top:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .case .item{background:#fff;padding:16px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid #eee}\\n    footer{margin-top:42px;padding:26px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .note{margin-top:10px;color:#666;font-size:13px}\\n    img.svg{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .pillars{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px\\\">\\n      <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>\\n      <span style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">— {{TAGLINE}}</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Focus Areas</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>About the practice — thoughtful, evidence-informed care</h1>\\n        <p>I\\u2019m {{THERAPIST_NAME}} ({{LICENSE}}). I work with adults in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} on anxiety, relationship strain, trauma recovery, and transitions. My work blends practical skills, reflective inquiry, and collaborative planning so you can move toward what matters to you.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">Sessions are confidential within legal limits. Not an emergency service. If you are in crisis, call your local emergency number or crisis line.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <img class=\\\"svg\\\" src=\\\"assets/img/hero.svg\\\" alt=\\\"Illustration of calm gallery scene\\\">\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"pillars\\\" aria-label=\\\"Core commitments\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n        <strong>Evidence-aware</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">I integrate techniques with research-informed thinking while attuning to your individual experience.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n        <strong>Collaborative</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">You are the expert on your life. We set goals together and check what\\u2019s actually helping.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n        <strong>Practical focus</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Tools that fit your rhythm: short experiments, communication skills, and pacing for longer work.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"grid-2\\\" aria-label=\\\"Common misconceptions\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"myth\\\">\\n        <strong>Myth</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Therapy will tell me what to do and fix everything quickly.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"truth\\\">\\n        <strong>Reality</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Therapy is a guided process that helps you discover patterns, try new approaches, and build skills. Change takes time and active practice.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"case\\\" aria-label=\\\"Client vignettes\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Illustrative client stories</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"item\\\">\\n        <strong>\\\"Reconnecting after burnout\\\"</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">A mid-career client learned small boundary habits and weekly rituals to reduce overwhelm and re-engage with meaning outside work.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"item\\\">\\n        <strong>\\\"Managing anxious mornings\\\"</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">We built a short morning routine, cognitive reframes, and exposure steps so panic symptoms became manageable within daily life.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"item\\\">\\n        <strong>\\\"Recovering trust after a break\\\"</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Through paced communication exercises and curiosity, a couple restored steady contact and clearer expectations.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:28px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 10px\\\">Questions people ask</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eee\\\">\\n        <strong>How long before I notice progress?</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Small changes sometimes appear within a few sessions; deeper patterns take longer. We make explicit, measurable goals and review them regularly.</p>\\n        <strong style=\\\"display:block;margin-top:12px\\\">Do you offer telehealth?</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Yes. I offer secure telehealth sessions and in-person appointments when available. Your privacy is protected within the limits of the platform and law.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"note\\\">Confidentiality note: Records are maintained securely. Legal limits to confidentiality include imminent harm, child/elder abuse, and court orders. This practice is not a crisis service.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:28px;padding:22px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#faf7ff,#fff);border-radius:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--accent)\\\">Ready to begin?</h3>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">If you\\u2019d like to schedule a first conversation, I offer a brief intake consult to see fit and pace.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • {{PHONE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"note\\\">Scope: I work with adults. I do not provide emergency services. If you are in immediate danger, call emergency services or your local crisis line.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"specialties.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Specialties — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--accent:#2a9d8f;--muted:#64666a;--bg:#fff}\\n    body{font-family:Georgia,serif;margin:0;color:#0b0b0b;background:var(--bg)}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:20px 34px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\\n    nav a{margin:0 10px;text-decoration:none;color:#111;font-weight:600}\\n    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:34px auto;padding:0 20px}\\n    .lead{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center}\\n    .lead .copy{flex:1}\\n    .lead h1{margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--accent);font-size:26px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .card{background:#fbfcfb;padding:16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #f0f2f1}\\n    .badge{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:700}\\n    .programs{margin-top:22px;display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .program{background:#fff;border:1px solid #eee;padding:12px;border-radius:8px}\\n    .faq{margin-top:26px}\\n    .cta{margin-top:26px;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f7fffb,#fff)}\\n    .cta a{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}\\n    img{max-width:320px;border-radius:8px}\\n    @media(max-width:800px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .lead{flex-direction:column}\\n      img{max-width:100%}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div><strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong></div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Programs</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"lead\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"copy\\\">\\n        <h1>Areas of focus — what I commonly support</h1>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Work is collaborative and tailored. Modalities: {{MODALITIES}}. Typical concerns below reflect what people bring most often.</p>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\"><strong>Note:</strong> Therapy is supportive and exploratory, not an emergency service. Confidentiality and privacy practices are upheld within legal limits.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"Therapist portrait illustration\\\">\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Anxiety & panic</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Practical tools for worry cycles, panic reduction, and tolerating uncertainty through paced exposures and skills training.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Trauma-informed care</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Stabilization, safety planning, and gradual processing when appropriate; we pace work to your tolerances.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Relationship work</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Communication patterns, attachment concerns, and negotiation skills for partners and individuals wanting clearer relationships.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Life transitions & identity</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Career change, grief, parenting shifts, and questions of identity — practical supports for decision-making and meaning.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"programs\\\" aria-label=\\\"Program options\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"program\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"badge\\\">Stabilize Series</span>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">A short 6-session plan focused on immediate coping skills and a clear follow-up plan.</p>\\n        <small style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Session pricing available on Fees page.</small>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"program\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"badge\\\">Deep Work Intensive</span>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">A time-limited block (10+ sessions) for sustained change and complex patterns.</p>\\n        <small style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Payment plans may be discussed.</small>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"program\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"badge\\\">Maintenance Sessions</span>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Monthly check-ins to support long-term gains and prevent relapse.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 10px\\\">Quick questions about fit</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eee\\\">\\n        <strong>Will you accept my insurance?</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">I operate primarily as an out-of-network provider. I can provide superbills for possible reimbursement; check with your insurer for details.</p>\\n        <strong style=\\\"display:block;margin-top:12px\\\">Do you work with couples?</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">I work with individuals and some couples; we discuss goals and boundaries early so each person\\u2019s needs are clear.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:26px\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Ready to explore whether this is a fit?</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">I offer a brief consult to answer questions and assess fit before committing to regular sessions.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:32px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">\\n      {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Crisis disclaimer: If you are in immediate danger or a mental health crisis, call emergency services or your local crisis line. This practice does not provide crisis intervention.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>How I Work — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--accent:#8b2be2;--muted:#5b5b64}\\n    body{font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;color:#121212;background:#fff}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 30px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\\n    nav a{margin:0 10px;text-decoration:none;color:#111}\\n    .frame{max-width:1100px;margin:34px auto;padding:0 20px}\\n    .main-hero{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;padding:26px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff7ff,#fff);border-radius:12px}\\n    .main-hero img{width:320px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .main-hero h1{margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .methods{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .method{background:#fff;padding:16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #f0eef6}\\n    .mythbusters{margin-top:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    .case-study{margin-top:20px;background:#fbfbfe;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eee}\\n    .cta{margin-top:22px;padding:16px;background:#fff8ff;border-radius:10px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .cta a{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}\\n    footer{margin-top:30px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.main-hero{flex-direction:column}.methods{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div><strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong></div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Who I Am</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Fees</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"frame\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"main-hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>How I work — a clear, paced process</h1>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px\\\">My approach combines relational stance, actionable skill-building, and measurement so we can both see what\\u2019s helping. Modalities: {{MODALITIES}}.</p>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 10px\\\">Typical session: check-in (10m), skill practice/processing (35m), summary & small assignment (5m). Flexibility is key; we adapt to what you need.</p>\\n        <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\" style=\\\"background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/pattern.svg\\\" alt=\\\"Decorative pattern illustration\\\">\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"methods\\\" aria-label=\\\"Core methods\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"method\\\">\\n        <strong>Skills-based practice</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">We use evidence-informed techniques (behavioral experiments, exposure, communication skills) matched to your goals.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"method\\\">\\n        <strong>Relational stance</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Therapy is collaborative; I notice patterns in session and offer gentle hypotheses rather than prescriptions.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"method\\\">\\n        <strong>Plan & measurement</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">We co-create measurable goals and review progress regularly to keep work practical and oriented to life changes.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"mythbusters\\\" aria-label=\\\"Common misunderstandings\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eee\\\">\\n        <strong>Therapy is only for \\\"serious\\\" problems.</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Many people seek therapy for manageable but persistent problems: better sleep, calmer mornings, clearer boundaries. These are valid reasons to seek support.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eee\\\">\\n        <strong>It has to take years.</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Some focused problems respond well to brief, structured intervention. Other issues require longer work; we set the scope together.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"case-study\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">A typical course: progressive exposure for social anxiety</h3>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0\\\">Over 8 sessions, a client and I built a ladder of graded social steps, rehearsed skills in session, and reflected on results weekly. By the end of the block the client reported more choice in social settings and fewer avoidance patterns.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"cta\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <strong style=\\\"display:block\\\">Programs & pricing</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Options include single sessions, the \\\"Foundations Pathway\\\" (8 sessions), and a longer \\\"Concierge Block\\\" for ongoing structural change. See Fees for details.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">View Fees</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}} • {{LICENSE}} • {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Privacy & scope: Client records are maintained securely. Therapy is not a substitute for emergency care. If you experience an emergency, call local emergency services.</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Confidentiality: I adhere to professional confidentiality standards; limits include imminent risk, abuse reporting, and court orders.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
